1 NAME Anders Bengtsson, till Aggarp (Hård af Torestorp)
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1524
2 PLAC Mollungen
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Od
3 CITY Herrljunga
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE AFT 28 AUG 1576
