2 CONT Norma Rosen 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Postat tisdagen 22 mars 2005 - 05:04       
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Sorry for writing in English. I can read with dictionary in hand but cannot write Swedish. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I would like a look-up please for Johan Nylander, (1737-1802) son of Magnus Mylander and Ulrica Lohm, married ?? Börsell. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a komminister in Älmeboda 1774-1802. I understand there is more about him and his family in the Växjö Stifts Herdaminne, Volume 4. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thanks for any help in this. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joakim Bång
2 CONT
2 CONT  Postat tisdagen 22 mars 2005 - 19:57       
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Hello Norma, 
2 CONT
2 CONT I don’t have Växjö stifts herdaminnen, but I have some information about his parents, especially his mother’s ancestors. It’s from Smolandi Upsalienses, a series of books about students from Småland at Uppsala University. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Magnus Nylander, kyrkoherde (priest) in Åker, born in Nöttja Nov. 22 1690, dead in Åker Nov. 7 1755. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married July 4 1721 with Ulrica Lohm, born 1702, dead in Åker Sept. 2 1757. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents of Ulrica Lohm: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gudmund Jönsson Lohm, komminister in Gällaryd, born in Rydaholm March 1644, dead in Gällaryd 1716. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Karin Gumaelia, born about 1659. Her parents: Jonas Magni Gummelius, kyrkoherde in Forsheda, born in Torskinge May 3 1611, dead in Forsheda 1680, and Maria Jacobsdotter Forselia, dead March 28 1698. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents of Gudmund Jönsson Lohm: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Lohm, parish clerk in Rydaholm. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Karin Månsdotter, born about 1615, dead in Gällaryd Feb. 8 1705. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents of Johan Lohm: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Torsten Larsson Lohm, kyrkoherde in Rydaholm, born in Lommaryd 1576, dead in Rydaholm 1665. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Karin Arvidsdotter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Smolandi Upsalienses II:457a, IV:1072 & 1100) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Regards 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joakim 
2 CONT
2 CONT Norma Rosen 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Postat torsdagen 24 mars 2005 - 20:00       
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Joakim 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thank you very much for this information. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Torsten Lohm is in my direct line and I didn't know where, or if, Ulrika fit. 
2 CONT
2 CONT There is a difference of opinion on Gudmundus' mother. Vistrand's "Smålands Nation i Uppsala" says she was Maria Klint, priest's daughter from Nydala. Back to the parish records to sort that one out I guess. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thank you again. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Inge Ledje 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Postat torsdagen 24 mars 2005 - 23:12       
