2 CONT ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
2 CONT Sophia Christensdatter BLOCH (Christen Jenssøn) was born about 1620. She married Michel Olufsen Storm, son of Ole Mikkelsen Storm and Benedicte Rasmusdatter, November 11, 1649 in Gildeskål, Nordland.2 She died after 1689
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sophia Christensdatter Bloch and Michel Olufsen Storm were: • + 13 in. Dorethe Michelsdatter Storm was born about 1650 in Bodo, Nordland. She married Peder Andersen Busch before 1677. She married Jochum Eriksen Bredal,
2 CONC  son of Erik Anderssøn Bredal and Johanne Willums Daughter Roger, in 1689.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole Storm was born about 1651 in Vefsen Præstegjeld. He married Anne Margrethe Schreuder, daughter of Samuel Hansen Schreuder and Cecilia Ovesdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Else Michelsdatter Storm was born about 1652 in Bodo, Nordland.She married Hans Hansen Sommerfeldt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Benedichte Michelsdatter Storm was born about 1653. She married Hans Pedersen Nyrop.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birgithe Sophie Michel Daughter Storm married Svend Hanssøn Blix, the son of Hans Lauritzen Blix and Ingeborg Svendsdatter, between 1670 and 1675.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen Michel Daughter Storm was born on February 17 1660. She married Jesper Andersen Kolderup approximately 1686.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 10 children 
2 CONT
