1 OCCU Farmer
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gotskalk was born in 1663 in Håland, Etne, and also died here. He took over the farm after his father around 1700, but had by then already managed the farm for a while. He is mentioned two times within the court sy
2 CONC stem, once for trading debt for a horse he had bought for his father from Knut Bjelland in Skånevik. And later for a unpayed "ver"(sheep; ram) he had received from Ola Dreganes in Ølen. He is connected to both trading in Bergen an
2 CONC d Nummedal. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Etne-soga by Ståle Dyrvik, vol II Bygde- og gardssoge 1660-1800 p 382 2a Indre Håland   - "Hans Rasmusson at Frette got from his brother Gotskalk his own land around 1715."
2 CONT
2 CONT Etne-soga by Ståle Dyrvik, vol V "Folket. Grindheim sokn." p 51 Indre  Håland item 50
