1 NAME Claes Claesson /Ekeblad/
2 GIVN Claes Claesson
2 _MARNM Ekeblad
2 NICK Clas
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 30 MAR 1708
2 PLAC Elbing, Polen
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Polen
1 DEAT
2 DATE 9 OCT 1771
2 PLAC Rådskammaren
