1 NAME Elisabeth /Papegoja/
2 GIVN Elisabeth
2 SURN Papegoja
2 _MARNM Papegoja
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1673
1 DEAT
2 DATE 8 APR 1774
