1 NAME Lars Elllingsen, Lerset i Salten /Ellingsen/
2 GIVN Lars Elllingsen, Lerset i Salten
2 SURN Ellingsen
2 _MARNM Ellingsen
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 DATE ABT 11 SEP 1712
