2 CONT I følge http://ritaren.tripod.com/bay.html : "The Bay Family book was published in Oslo in 1943. It seems as if the family was quite prominent in Norway. Most of the men were officers within the Norwegian Military. Even some men w
2 CONC ho married into the family would use the surname of Bay instead of their own. Sophie Helmen, born about 1676 and died September 1763, in Vinger, Norway Adolph Carl Helm, born 1685 and died May 1754. He served as a Colonel in the N
2 CONC orwegian Military. He was married twice with no children  Peder Christian Helm, born October 1689, died January 13, 1750 in Ytterøen, Norway. He served as a Colonel in the Norwegian Military.  Bastain Helm, died 1718. We now that 
2 CONC he had 6 children but have no further information. Petronelle Helmen  Margrethe Helm, born about 1676, died 1731. Married Niels Knudsen Hals.  Karen Helm, born November 1688, died 1729. Married Niels Guttormsen Hafnor  Maren Helme
2 CONC n, born about 1686, died June 1763. Married Christen Godager  Hilleborg Helmen, married Ole Rasmussen on October 24, 1708 in Gran, Norway Anne Helmen, died July 31, 1744. Married Tosten Daggson Langeland."
2 CONT --------------------
