2 GIVN Georg
2 SURN Stiernhoff
2 _MARNM Stiernhoff
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 10 OCT 1729
2 PLAC Bredsätra
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bro
3 STAE Stockholms län
3 CTRY Sverige
1 DEAT
2 DATE 29 APR 1807
