1 NOTE !Elin Barkman Ashenhurst, Colorado Springs, CO says marriage was before 1733
1 NOTE !Information from Elin Barkman Ashenhurst, Colorado Springs, CO (1999)
2 CONT
2 CONT From the book "KARL XII:S OFFICERARE Biografiska antechningar au ADAM
2 CONT LEWENHAUPT Forsta delen" 1929   In 1707 Charles XII, the then 18 year old King
2 CONT of Sweden invaded Russia and made straight for the centre of Russian power in
2 CONT Moscow; the same strategy followed by Napoleon 100 years later.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Swedish army was defeated at Poltava, 1709.  The army of 15,000 men capitulated to the Russian cavalry.  Johan Berchman, born 1686 in Villstad, was a lieutenant with Charles XII army.  He was a prisoner of war with other Swede
2 CONC s in Moscow under Peter the Great until 1722, 12 years.  After he got back to Sweden, at the age of 36, he married Martha Maria Baumgardt and lived on Crown property in Sodra Hestra and had 6 children
2 CONT
2 CONT !Info from Elias Beckstrand file:
2 CONT Name spelling also Berchman
2 CONT Info from Brps Ostergotland Langaryd Parish rec. by: Paul Beckstrand while in
2 CONT the Air Force in Germany in Aug 1976 while researching in the Vadstena Archives
2 CONT in Sweden
2 CONT Landsarkivet Vadstena is stamped on Original Family Group Record Sheet
2 CONT Born: abt 1700 Villstad, Jonkoping, Sweden
2 CONT Died: 10 Jan 1747
2 CONT Bapt: 22 May 1928 Manti Film 170,411
2 CONT Endow: 14 Feb 1929 Manti Film 170,457 p. 446 Line 12267
2 CONT Sld to Parents: not known
2 CONT Sld to spouse:15 May 1929 MT 170,518 p.306 line 7132
2 CONT .
